<title>SOUTH AFRICA: STEERS CAUTIONS STILL IN TALKS.</title>
<headline>STEERS CAUTIONS STILL IN TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African fastfood group, Steers Holdings Ltd, said on Friday it was still in talks on a further acquisition which if successful could have a material effect on its share price. </p>
<p>The company advised caution in dealing in its shares until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
</text>
